  "notes": "サポート is from English \"support.\" Widely used in business, technology, and service contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- サポートする: to support\n- サポートを{受|う}ける: to receive support\n- サポート{体制|たいせい}: support system/structure\n- テクニカルサポート: technical support\n- カスタマーサポート: customer support\n\nUSAGE:\nPrimarily used for practical/organizational support — help desks, assistance programs, technical aid. For emotional or moral support, native Japanese words are more natural.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {支援|しえん}: support, assistance (formal, institutional)\n- {応援|おうえん}: cheering, moral support (encouragement)\n- {援助|えんじょ}: aid, assistance (formal, often financial)\n- {手助|てだす}け: help, a helping hand (casual, practical)",
